{"name":"N\u00fat B\u1ea5m Li\u00ean H\u1ec7 Dibrother","slug":"dibrother-floating-buttons","version":"2.1.2","author":"<a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/dibrother\/\">Di Brother<\/a>","author_profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/dibrother\/","contributors":{"dibrother":{"profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/dibrother\/","avatar":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/dfeee56c33fc4d16a056868d483cca949c706b63ac00033cb679f6eb75a9856f?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g","display_name":"Di Brother"}},"requires":"5.0","tested":"6.8.12","requires_php":false,"requires_plugins":[],"rating":100,"ratings":{"5":2,"4":0,"3":0,"2":0,"1":0},"num_ratings":2,"support_url":"https:\/\/wordpress.org\/support\/plugin\/dibrother-floating-buttons\/","support_threads":2,"support_threads_resolved":0,"active_installs":1000,"last_updated":"2025-09-06 8:12am GMT","added":"2025-09-02","homepage":"","sections":{"description":"<p>B\u1ea1n \u0111ang t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm m\u1ed9t plugin th\u00eam n\u00fat li\u00ean h\u1ec7 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cho website WordPress? N\u00fat B\u1ea5m Li\u00ean H\u1ec7 Dibrother l\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i t\u1ee9c th\u00ec v\u1edbi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng qua c\u00e1c n\u00fat g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n, Zalo, Messenger c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p. C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t ch\u1ec9 trong v\u00e0i ph\u00fat, t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, v\u1ecb tr\u00ed d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n bi\u1ebft code. T\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ngay h\u00f4m nay!<\/p>\n<p>T\u00cdNH N\u0102NG CH\u00cdNH:<\/p>\n<p>\u0110a K\u00eanh Li\u00ean L\u1ea1c: T\u00edch h\u1ee3p s\u1eb5n c\u00e1c n\u00fat ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u1ea5t: G\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n, Zalo, Facebook Messenger.<\/p>\n<p>N\u00fat L\u00ean \u0110\u1ea7u Trang: C\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tr\u00ean c\u00e1c trang d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p>T\u00f9y Ch\u1ec9nh D\u1ec5 D\u00e0ng: Thay \u0111\u1ed5i m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, v\u1ecb tr\u00ed (tr\u00e1i\/ph\u1ea3i) v\u00e0 b\u1eadt\/t\u1eaft hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng s\u00f3ng thu h\u00fat.<\/p>\n<p>Ho\u00e0n To\u00e0n \u0110\u00e1p \u1ee8ng: Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1eaft tr\u00ean m\u1ecdi thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb t\u1eeb m\u00e1y t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i di \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/p>\n<p>Nh\u1eb9 &amp; T\u1ed1i \u01afu: M\u00e3 ngu\u1ed3n s\u1ea1ch, kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m ch\u1eadm website c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/p>\n<p>Chu\u1ea9n SEO: C\u00e1c li\u00ean k\u1ebft ngo\u00e0i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng th\u00eam rel=&#8221;nofollow&#8221;.<\/p>\n","installation":"<p>T\u1ea3i file .zip c\u1ee7a plugin v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<p>Trong trang qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb WordPress, v\u00e0o Plugins &gt; Add New.<\/p>\n<p>Nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o Upload Plugin v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn file .zip b\u1ea1n v\u1eeba t\u1ea3i.<\/p>\n<p>Nh\u1ea5p Install Now v\u00e0 sau \u0111\u00f3 Activate Plugin.<\/p>\n<p>\u0110i t\u1edbi Settings &gt; N\u00fat B\u1ea5m Li\u00ean H\u1ec7 Dibrother \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh.<\/p>\n","faq":"\n<h4>\nL\u00e0m th\u1ebf n\u00e0o \u0111\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i m\u00e0u s\u1eafc c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c n\u00fat?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>Trong trang c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t c\u1ee7a plugin, m\u1ed7i n\u00fat s\u1ebd c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn b\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u. B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn m\u00e0u m\u00ecnh mong mu\u1ed1n.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<h4>\nPlugin c\u00f3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i kh\u00f4ng?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>C\u00f3, plugin \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o tr\u00ean m\u1ecdi thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb di \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh b\u1ea3ng.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<h4>\nPlugin c\u00f3 l\u00e0m ch\u1eadm website c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>Kh\u00f4ng. Plugin \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vi\u1ebft v\u1edbi m\u00e3 ngu\u1ed3n r\u1ea5t nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o kh\u00f4ng \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u1ea3i trang.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n\n","changelog":"<h4>2.1.1<\/h4>\n<p>C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt file readme.txt v\u00e0 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eeda l\u1ed7i hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o tr\u00ean trang plugin c\u1ee7a WordPress.org.<\/p>\n<h4>2.1<\/h4>\n<p>Vi\u1ec7t h\u00f3a to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 plugin.<\/p>\n<p>C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt t\u00ean v\u00e0 c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh danh \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h4>2.0<\/h4>\n<p>S\u1eecA L\u1ed6I B\u1ea2O M\u1eacT: Th\u00eam h\u00e0m esc_url() cho t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ec3 tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n c\u1ee7a WordPress.org.<\/p>\n","screenshots":"<ol><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/dibrother-floating-buttons\/assets\/screenshot-1.png?rev=3356985\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/dibrother-floating-buttons\/assets\/screenshot-1.png?rev=3356985\" alt=\"\"><\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/dibrother-floating-buttons\/assets\/screenshot-2.png?rev=3356985\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/dibrother-floating-buttons\/assets\/screenshot-2.png?rev=3356985\" alt=\"\"><\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/dibrother-floating-buttons\/assets\/screenshot-3.png?rev=3356985\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/dibrother-floating-buttons\/assets\/screenshot-3.png?rev=3356985\" alt=\"\"><\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/dibrother-floating-buttons\/assets\/screenshot-4.png?rev=3356985\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/dibrother-floating-buttons\/assets\/screenshot-4.png?rev=3356985\" alt=\"\"><\/a><\/li><\/ol>","reviews":"<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\